    <string name="battery_title">Battery and reliability</string>
    <string name="battery_body">Blocking is event driven, so nothing runs every second. The timer is drawn by the system. If your phone kills background apps (Xiaomi, Samsung, Huawei), also allow Focus Guard to run in the background in the phone\'s battery settings.</string>
